<!--heading--><h1 class="chap"><div class="dropdown"><button class="dropbtn"><img width="16" height="16" src="./D3_use_case_new(1)_files/edit1.svg"></button><div class="dropdown-content"><a href="http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/doc/dokuwiki/en/index#0"><img width="20" height="20" src="./D3_use_case_new(1)_files/dokuwiki.png"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;">Edit di Dokuwiki</font></font></a><a href="http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/doc/asciidoc/en/index#0"><img width="20" height="20" src="./D3_use_case_new(1)_files/asciidoc32.png"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;">Edit dalam Asciidoc</font></font></a><a href="http://alphadoc.plantuml.com/doc/markdown/en/index#0"><img width="20" height="20" src="./D3_use_case_new(1)_files/markdown.png"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;">Edit dalam Markdown</font></font></a></div></div><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;">🌱 Sekilas tentang PlantUML</font></font></h1>
